            "review_title": "Review at Yamamoto Mattcha Cafe",
            "review_text": "pccruise76\nsingapore35 contributions\n0\nLove Matcha\nDec 2016 • Friends\ni love Matcha so when i saw this restaurant in Takashimaya Saigon Center, I had to try it out. Glad i came with friends as get to try 2 desserts and its good for sharing as well, Matcha Ice cream on waffle cone is the best! Waffle cup is cinnamon flavored and and really goes well with the sweet red bean dessert and glutinous rice ball. Another highly recommende is their shaved ice topped with sweet red bean sauce and of course the glutinous rice ball. 2 different desserts but similar ingredients but different when taken together taste is not the same..Must try..:) Happy customer\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 19, 2017",
