            "review_text": "Chloe L\n12 contributions\n0\nFrom a matcha lover♥\nSep 2015 • Friends\nBeen here with my bestie who is obsessed with Japan's culture, recommended to try the Matcha ice cream with mashed red beans and I did, it was like heaven, the best Matcha dessert in town, love it so so so much♥ but felt a little bit disappointed with the matcha pancake, it's served hot but a little bit dry, lack of softness, but whatever, the matcha ice cream convinced me, absolutely will come back. A must go place for ppl who loves matcha.\nRead more\nWritten September 20, 2015",
